message: "If you use this material, please cite it as below. Not peer reviewed. Produced by AI models under the direction of the repository owner (see AI_DISCLOSURE.md)."
title: "The kissing number in dimension 3 is 12: a Lean 4 formalisation via a three-point certificate"
type: software
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23100212"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/alejandrozarco/kissing-number-3"
authors:
  - name: alejandrozarco
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 proof, checked by the Lean kernel, that the kissing number of three-dimensional space is 12: twelve explicit
  points for the lower bound, and an exact Bachoc-Vallentin three-point certificate for thirteen points for the upper
  bound. Not peer reviewed.
keywords:
  - kissing number
  - thirteen spheres problem
  - semidefinite programming
  - three-point bound
  - computer-assisted proof
  - Lean 4
